<tr>
<td>
<h3>What is tCAP?</h3>
<p>tCAP is a structured, multiyear career development program designed exclusively for undergraduate students in the Bellini College. Instead of waiting until their final year to focus on internships and career preparation, tCAP helps students steadily build experience, skills and professional connections throughout their academic journey.</p>
</td>
<td>
<h3>Why tCAP matters?</h3>
<p>Employers increasingly seek graduates who can communicate effectively, collaborate on teams, use critical thinking skills to solve problems and contribute immediately in professional environments. tCAP combines career readiness, experiential learning and employer engagement to help develop those capabilities before graduation.</p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
