<tr>
<td>
<h3>A Four-Stage Path to Career Readiness</h3>
<p style="font-size: 16px; color: #000000;">Each stage builds on the last, so students keep developing career readiness, technical confidence and professional experience all the way to graduation.</p>

~[com[23820 10 5{ "version": 5, "data": {"0b9ff278bb43569aaf5286507d834270":"Yes","b9f3592988b3bea636b875f3981d3d67":"Default","64697919ca70c018318bc5df3632541f":"Choose an experience","d27658aac18dc678712660d0c0e91096":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Semester 1 (1 Credit)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;You start building the professional basics: a resume that works, a LinkedIn that gets you noticed, a GitHub that shows your work, and a clear sense of your goals.&lt;/p&gt;","5aba1636b2e0a3ab06c8ec1ca91e2616":"student at desk","2f5ee4929def77d47d4ac4d9273df508":"{{f:84163796}}","60f763dec32e20edc085aeb1d58d957f":"Freshmen Year"}}]]~

~[com[23820 9 5{ "version": 5, "data": {"0b9ff278bb43569aaf5286507d834270":"Yes","b9f3592988b3bea636b875f3981d3d67":"Default","64697919ca70c018318bc5df3632541f":"Core Application","d27658aac18dc678712660d0c0e91096":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Semester 3 (1 Credit) -- Semester 4 (1 Credit)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;em&gt;Experiential Lab &amp;lowast; Industry Software&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Mentorship, leadership opportunities and networking turn what you know into professional confidence. This is also where your first hands-on labs start, built using the same software our industry partners use on the job.&lt;/p&gt;","5aba1636b2e0a3ab06c8ec1ca91e2616":"Student with laptop","2f5ee4929def77d47d4ac4d9273df508":"{{f:84163798}}","60f763dec32e20edc085aeb1d58d957f":"Sophmore Year"}}]]~

~[com[23820 11 5{ "version": 5, "data": {"0b9ff278bb43569aaf5286507d834270":"Yes","b9f3592988b3bea636b875f3981d3d67":"Default","64697919ca70c018318bc5df3632541f":"Advanced Practice","d27658aac18dc678712660d0c0e91096":"&lt;strong&gt;Semester 5 (1 Credit)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;em&gt;Experiential Lab &amp;lowast; Industry Software&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Career readiness gets real: internship prep, employer and alumni engagement, career fair coaching, interview practice and team-based projects with actual deliverables.","5aba1636b2e0a3ab06c8ec1ca91e2616":"Students at Reliaquest","2f5ee4929def77d47d4ac4d9273df508":"{{f:84163797}}","60f763dec32e20edc085aeb1d58d957f":"Junior Year"}}]]~

~[com[23820 12 5{ "version": 5, "data": {"0b9ff278bb43569aaf5286507d834270":"Yes","b9f3592988b3bea636b875f3981d3d67":"Default","64697919ca70c018318bc5df3632541f":"Professional Mastery","d27658aac18dc678712660d0c0e91096":"&lt;strong&gt;Semester 5 (1 Credit) -- Semester 7 (No Credit Hours)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;em&gt;Career Ready&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;You prove it -- through a capstone, advanced coursework, certifications and an intership or job placement. Most students finish junior year already career ready. Senior year is yours.","5aba1636b2e0a3ab06c8ec1ca91e2616":"Students all done!","2f5ee4929def77d47d4ac4d9273df508":"{{f:84163795}}","60f763dec32e20edc085aeb1d58d957f":"Junior Year"}}]]~
</td>
</tr>
